#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:263
msgid "Three controls apply, and none replaces another."
msgstr "以下三项控制同时适用，互不替代。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:265
msgid ""
"**Cursor.** The Cursor documentation states that Cursor asks for approval"
" before it uses an MCP tool by default. The command-line agent has the "
"flags ``--approve-mcps`` and ``--trust`` in its parameter reference. A "
"report in the Cursor forum states that a non-interactive run (``-p``) "
"needs prior approval of the server; the effect of the flags in such a run"
" has not been verified for this guide, and the parameter reference of the"
" current version applies."
msgstr ""
"**Cursor。** Cursor 文档说明，Cursor 默认在使用 MCP 工具之前请求批准。命令行 Agent 的参数参考中有 "
"``--approve-mcps`` 与 ``--trust``。Cursor "
"论坛中有报告称，非交互运行（``-p``）需要事先批准该服务器；这两个参数在此类运行中的效果尚未为本指南核实，以当前版本的参数参考为准。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:271
msgid ""
"**Inbound policy.** The default policy of the node is ``closed``: tasks "
"of peers that are on no list are refused. Approval of a held task is a "
"terminal action (``anet inbound approve``); the MCP server can only list "
"held tasks with ``inbound_pending``. The text of a task from another "
"agent is untrusted input. See :doc:`../topics/delegation`."
msgstr ""
"**入站策略。** 节点的默认策略为 ``closed``：不在任何名单中的对端发来的任务一律拒绝。批准被挂起的任务是终端操作（``anet "
"inbound approve``）；MCP 服务器只能通过 ``inbound_pending`` 列出被挂起的任务。其他 Agent "
"所发任务的文本属于不可信输入。参见 :doc:`../topics/delegation`。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:276
msgid ""
"**Payments.** ``submit_payment`` signs within the limits of the agent "
"spending tier. A quote above them stays in ``input-required`` until a "
"person runs ``anet pay`` at a terminal. The limits are those of the node "
"and are not widened by a setting in Cursor. See "
":doc:`../topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"**付款。** ``submit_payment`` 在 Agent 支出档位的限额之内签名。超出限额的报价停留在 ``input-"
"required``，直至有人在终端运行 ``anet pay``。限额属于节点，不会因 Cursor 中的设置而放宽。参见 "
":doc:`../topics/payments`。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:281
msgid ""
"The server cannot read or change the keys, the identity or the "
"configuration of the node. Task content that a capability executes on the"
" other side is bounded by that node; the sandbox of the local node is "
"described in :doc:`../topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"该服务器不能读取或修改节点的密钥、身份和配置。能力在对端执行的任务内容，由对端节点约束；本节点的沙箱见 "
":doc:`../topics/sandbox`。"

