"Run ``anet status`` in a terminal. ``[daemon_not_running]``: run ``anet "
"up``. ``anet`` not found: set ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` or ask the agent to run"
" the ``anet-setup`` skill. Then start a new session."
msgstr ""
"在终端中运行 ``anet status``\\ 。出现 ``[daemon_not_running]``\\ ：运行 ``anet up``\\"
